# Micro-probe batteries — pool 20,000, guard 2,000,000, task deliberately unsolvable

## A. Arity tax (depth 2)

Each cell = the base floor plus ONE primitive. All GRID -> GRID, so survivors land in the
same census bucket and the only thing moving is the number of argument slots.

cell                        leaves   considered  x base    secs   r1 pred   r1 real                    per round  flags
base (3 unary)                   1           13    1.0x     0.0         3         3                        1,3,9  
+ identity (arity 1)             1           17    1.3x     0.0         4         4                       1,4,12  
+ scale (arity 2)                5           47    3.6x     0.0         7         7                       5,7,35  
+ translate (arity 3)            5          252   19.4x     0.0        19        19                     5,19,228  
+ set_cell (arity 4)            15       15,174 1167.2x     0.3       163       163                15,163,14,996  
+ move_cell (arity 5)            5       19,689 1514.5x     0.4       259       259                 5,259,19,425  

