## A2. Same arity, different slot types (depth 2)

Three arity-3 GRID -> GRID primitives. Identical arity, identical return bucket; the only
difference is whether a slot draws from INT (0..max-dim, so 4 here) or COLOR (0..9, so 10).

cell                        leaves   considered  x base    secs   r1 pred   r1 real                    per round  flags
base (3 unary)                   1           13    1.0x     0.0         3         3                        1,3,9  
+ translate (grid,int,int)       5          252   19.4x     0.0        19        19                     5,19,228  
+ pad (grid,int,color)          15        1,477  113.6x     0.0        43        43                  15,43,1,419  
+ map_color (grid,col,col)      11        9,693  745.6x     0.2       103       103                 11,103,9,579  

