## B. Constant-domain width (depth 2)

Fixed library (base + `translate`: two INT slots), fixed task; only the constant policy
moves. `leaves` is the round-0 census the policy actually mints — the measured width the
cost should be read against, rather than a width chosen in advance.

cell                        leaves   considered  x base    secs   r1 pred   r1 real                    per round  flags
no constants                     1           13    1.0x     0.0         3         3                        1,3,9  
harvest-from-instance            2           22    1.7x     0.0         4         4                       2,4,16  
finite-enumerate                 5          252   19.4x     0.0        19        19                     5,19,228  
both                             6          253   19.5x     0.0        19        19                     6,19,228  

