## C. If-tax (depth 2)

`if` is not an ordinary primitive: it summons an `If` node over a BOOL condition x every
ORDERED same-typed branch pair, so its term is quadratic in the pool where a primitive's
is a product of type populations. `gt` is included to supply real BOOL conditions — with
no BOOL producer the only conditions are the two enumerated literals.

cell                        leaves   considered  x base    secs   r1 pred   r1 real                    per round  flags
base                             1           13    1.0x     0.0         3         3                        1,3,9  
base + if                        3           43    3.3x     0.0         7         7                       3,7,33  
base + gt                        7           35    2.7x     0.0        19        19                       7,19,9  
base + gt + if                   7           87    6.7x     0.0        47        47                      7,47,33  

## C. If-tax (depth 3)

`if` is not an ordinary primitive: it summons an `If` node over a BOOL condition x every
ORDERED same-typed branch pair, so its term is quadratic in the pool where a primitive's
is a product of type populations. `gt` is included to supply real BOOL conditions — with
no BOOL producer the only conditions are the two enumerated literals.

cell                        leaves   considered  x base    secs   r1 pred   r1 real                    per round  flags
base                             1           22    1.0x     0.0         3         3                      1,3,9,9  
base + if                        3          112    5.1x     0.0         7         7                    3,7,33,69  
base + gt                        7           44    2.0x     0.0        19        19                     7,19,9,9  
base + gt + if                   7          156    7.1x     0.0        47        47                   7,47,33,69  

## D. Arity trade (depth 2)

Same expressible set of translations, two spellings. The arity-3 floor spends one round;
the arity-2 floor spends two rounds but a narrower product per round.

cell                        leaves   considered  x base    secs   r1 pred   r1 real                    per round  flags
arity-3 `translate`              5          252    1.0x     0.0        19        19                     5,19,228  
arity-2 x2 (h then v)            5          104    0.4x     0.0        11        11                      5,11,88  

